# Evaluate and plot the gradus_lamp_thin model on a dummy response.
# The first evaluation ray-traces the L(g) kernel (about a minute); the
# kernel is cached on disk afterwards.
#
# gradus_lamp_thin parameters: 1 spin, 2 inc, 3 h, 4-8 xillver
# (Gamma, A_Fe, logXi, Dens, Incl), 9 redshift, 10 norm.
#
# Run from the repository root:
#   xspec - examples/xspec/lamp_thin_demo.xcm
lmod gradusxspec .
dummyrsp 0.5 10.0 300 log
model gradus_lamp_thin & /*
# Lower the source to h = 2 r_g: stronger central illumination, broader red wing.
newpar 3 2.0
setplot energy
cpd /xs
plot model
